LRC DISTANCE-TOURNAMENT TWO-NEIGHBOR LENS (oracle-2026-05-31-S22)
============================================================================================================
Rows include initial boundary systems, quotient ladders, and S21 coarse-row completions for n=14,15,16.
pos/ties/coll/anti means number of position classes, lex tie pairs, collision pairs, and antipodal pairs.

